{
  "id": "p26",
  "title": "The Mystery at the Auto Museum",
  "titleZh": "汽车博物馆的谜案",
  "topic": "旧工厂博物馆",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My cousin works at a former auto empire near the town.",
        "zh": "我的表亲在小镇附近一家旧汽车帝国工作。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One rider won a championship with the power of this engine.",
        "zh": "一位骑手用这台发动机的动力赢得过冠军。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Two firms compete, and their ownership and relationship stay unclear.",
        "zh": "两家公司竞争，它们的归属和关系仍不清楚。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My aunt's small organization plans a historic show about the plant.",
        "zh": "我姑姑的小机构计划为这家工厂办一场历史展览。"
      },
      {
        "en": "It marks a demonstration and a ceasefire from the old days.",
        "zh": "它记录了旧日的一场游行和一次停火。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A brief wall text explains the communist period and its old leaders.",
        "zh": "一段简短的墙面文字解释共产主义时期及其老领导人。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One room remembers the violence and a young victim.",
        "zh": "一个展厅纪念那场暴力和一位年轻的受害者。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Another shows the tragedy that ruined the northern site.",
        "zh": "另一个展厅展示毁掉北区厂址的悲剧。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An ordinary worker kept the old machines stable for many years.",
        "zh": "一位普通工人让那些旧机器稳定运转了许多年。"
      },
      {
        "en": "His long journey to work went via two busy river bridges.",
        "zh": "他上班的长途路程要经过两座繁忙的河桥。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "The plant covers many acres of raw, open ground today.",
        "zh": "如今这家工厂占地许多英亩，是一片未开发的土地。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A grey uniform hangs beside a faded company flag on the wall.",
        "zh": "墙上一件灰色制服挂在一面褪色的公司旗旁。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Workers install an electronic guide beside each old car.",
        "zh": "工人在每辆老车旁安装电子讲解器。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then a strange mystery occurs during the quiet night.",
        "zh": "然后，安静的夜里发生了一件奇怪的谜事。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A guard investigates the rooms and assesses every lock.",
        "zh": "一名保安检查房间，评估每一把锁。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One obvious clue earns him credit with the museum director.",
        "zh": "一个明显的线索让他在馆长那里赢得赞誉。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Someone removed a small box of old stuff from the desk.",
        "zh": "有人从桌上拿走了一小箱旧东西。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later she edits her draft about the missing wooden box.",
        "zh": "后来她编辑关于那只丢失木箱的草稿。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My sister, a creative youngster, draws the scene from memory.",
        "zh": "我妹妹是个有创意的孩子，凭记忆画下了那个场景。"
      },
      {
        "en": "On behalf of the museum, she makes a firm pledge.",
        "zh": "她代表博物馆郑重许下承诺。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A museum convention follows, and subsequent rules change slowly.",
        "zh": "随后博物馆召开大会，之后的规则慢慢改变。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The mood is tense, and a few tired guests look upset.",
        "zh": "气氛紧张，几位疲惫的客人显得不安。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then confusion may arise before the morning chaos ends.",
        "zh": "然后，在清晨的混乱结束前可能会出现困惑。"
      },
      {
        "en": "From another angle, the old box shows a characteristic mark.",
        "zh": "从另一个角度看，那只旧箱子有一个特有的标记。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Careful preparation brings a clear improvement to the whole show.",
        "zh": "细致的准备让整场展览有了明显的提升。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The economics of the plant imply a slow and quiet decline.",
        "zh": "这家工厂的经济状况暗示着缓慢而安静的衰落。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A previous owner began his long career in this hall.",
        "zh": "一位前任老板在这个大厅里开始了他的漫长职业生涯。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Specifically, the old banner vanished overnight without any trace.",
        "zh": "具体来说，那条旧横幅一夜之间消失得无影无踪。"
      }
    ]
  ],
